# Forward-only probes: tape mode (-c) refuses them BY DESIGN, one per line:
# <probe> <undefined-name-set> <one-line reason>
#
# These probes call names that exist only via host forwarding (fwd_stub on
# -run / full builds); the tape text mode has no forwarding, so the refusal
# is the correct answer, not a defect (root cause:
# research/c43-optrun-fenv-wctype-tape-red.md, mechanism src/front_parse.c
# fwdrun-only forwarding since 10433612).
#
# This is NOT difftest.knownfail: these probes PASS full builds (-o, -run),
# so listing them there would be a false red.  Discipline is the same as the
# knownfail ledgers, inverted at the right spot: a probe listed here whose
# tape build starts PASSING is a FAILURE -- close the gap by deleting its
# line, so the list cannot rot. Every listed probe still runs at both levels.
# Fields: probe, exact comma-separated undefined names, reason.
71_llrint_llround_nearbyint llrint,llround,nearbyint forward-only; tape refusal retains both execution checks
72_remainder_remquo_fma remainder,remquo,fma forward-only; tape refusal retains both execution checks
73_acosh_erf_tgamma acosh,asinh,atanh,erf,erfc,lgamma,tgamma forward-only; tape refusal retains both execution checks
74_strxfrm_wcscoll_wcsxfrm strxfrm,wcscoll,wcsxfrm forward-only; tape refusal retains both execution checks
75_fenv fesetround,fegetround,feclearexcept,fetestexcept,feraiseexcept,fegetexceptflag,fesetexceptflag,fegetenv,fesetenv,feholdexcept,feupdateenv forward-only; tape refusal retains both execution checks
76_wctype iswalpha,iswdigit,iswxdigit,iswalnum,iswupper,iswlower,iswspace,iswblank,iswcntrl,iswprint,iswgraph,iswpunct,towupper,towlower,wctype,iswctype,wctrans,towctrans forward-only; tape refusal retains both execution checks
81_wcstoll_wcstoull wcstoll,wcstoull forward-only; tape refusal retains both execution checks
